Package: TwoSampleCalImpute
Type: Package
Title: Two-Sample Calibrated Imputation for Survey Data
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: person("Samuel Joel Kamun", email = "samuelkamun@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Provides utilities for preparing, validating, summarising, and
    documenting survey data from primary and auxiliary samples, and for
    specifying and checking survey-design information. The package supports
    data-management and design-specification steps in two-sample calibrated
    imputation workflows. For background on survey calibration, see Deville
    and Särndal (1992) <doi:10.1080/01621459.1992.10475217>.
